qwen27b-jev


Jev-style decisions on Qwen3.8-27B: one forward pass, softmax
over the answer-letter logits, a probability per option. No
token sampled, no JSON parsed. Prefill a state once, ask many
questions.


    from jev import Jev

    llm = Jev()
    llm.decide(state, question, {"yes": "It did.", "no": "It did not."})
    llm.decide_many(state, [(question, options), ...])

    $ ./run.sh uv run example.py


Port of https://github.com/TheoLeeCJ/openjev from 4B to 27B.
